	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14007"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=4" title="View the profile of Runfassa">Runfassa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 10<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.kentmbrown.com/PDF/Faned/Faned_pulling.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Mad Monk<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=20522626" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=20522626&amp;img=5" alt="20522626" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=SenseiFaned&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="SenseiFaned" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=4"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.reignofswords.com" title="Reign of Swords" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:faned@reignofswords.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg14007#msg14007"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg14007#msg14007">Re: What was your first guild?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #62 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 08:56:09 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							My first guild was Dragonflyers.  I believe it was the first guild to exist on Rodcet Nife, formed in June &#039;99 I think (it&#039;s been a loooooong time, the memories grow fuzzy, but my guildtag was the first time I ever saw someone with a guildtag).  It became Cascade Point, along with a fair helping of Hawkwood&#039;s.  As the game evolved, a large guild (and Cascade Point at its largest was monstrous by any measure) turned out to be a hindrance, and so Reign of Swords was formed with a focus on progression.<br /><br />In my heart, I consider them all the same guild, as each was formed by some of the same founders.  So in essence, I&#039;ve only been in one guild for my entire time playing.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://tinyurl.com/71t8" alt="" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
