								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg14016#msg14016">Re: What was your first guild?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #63 on:</b> January 28, 2005, 09:45:45 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
