							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg13998#msg13998">Quote from: Toastie on January 27, 2005, 05:21:26 pm</a></div><div class="quote">hi corisma<br /></div><br />Hey Bud... <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley5.gif" alt="smiley5" border="0" />
