								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg14054#msg14054">Re: What was your first guild?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #68 on:</b> January 30, 2005, 11:28:49 am &#187;</span></td>
