								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">It became Cascade Point, along with a fair helping of Hawkwood&#039;s.  As the game evolved, a large guild (and Cascade Point at its largest was monstrous by any measure) turned out to be a hindrance, and so Reign of Swords was formed with a focus on progression</div>Then of course after RoS, there was the split off to form Conviction.<br />However, I&#039;m the only original member of Cascade Point that still exists in Conviction today. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
						</td>
