							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg14022#msg14022">Quote from: Somthing on January 28, 2005, 02:51:28 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Bloodhaven Clan<br /></div><br />Somthing!!  Best BL on the server... hands down.  Miss you man.<br />Tylaric--you still kicking around?  Surprised you&#039;re not over in Silenti...I&#039;m not either, went PvP in WoW.  Hope you&#039;re doing well, sir.<br /><br />EDIT:&nbsp; My first guild was a guild started by a group of us on Vox/Naggy runs, Strength with Honor.&nbsp; From there I went to Hegemony.&nbsp; That&#039;s it.&nbsp; Not very exciting, I know.
						</td>
					</tr>
